{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_01",
  "title": "化物",
  "storyCode": "IW-1",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "63487fd4eddc685056759c01f7037579d0c6ad29fd9fa69e99321f26d9e4aed7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "客栈在尚蜀有十数个分号。不过，分号并不叫行裕，也许叫行禄，也许叫行福，而叫行裕的，只此一家。\n当然也只此一家，既能见近处高楼夜景，亦能眺远方双月映湖。掌柜的选址，从来只看风景。至于什么客流，租价，那是从来不在意的。\n风景好了，客人心情就好。风景好了，便是与天地同心，想不赚钱都难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......确实是好茶，好景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "初来乍到，挑个好地方落脚。对尚蜀有个好印象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行裕客栈，很古雅的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是家名店，但最早不是做餐饮这行的，不过这些年突然转了行，掌柜的有本事，做起生意来也是顺风顺水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便家大业大，老掌柜的也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是那位忙忙碌碌的老先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半点看不出老板模样，兢兢业业，令人心生敬佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是不知道我那位姓梁的昔日同窗......如今在做什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己说了嘛，兢兢业业。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是个好官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "街上随便拉个路人，擦鞋的，卖山芋的，或者出租车司机，谁提到梁大人都竖大拇指。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哈哈，那也算是他得偿所愿了，羡慕不来啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听梁大人提起，你与他，已有十多年没见了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可梁大人依然选你，来送这件货物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你俩的关系，也要竖大拇指了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没见识，看不出这东西的好坏，只是看梁大人那神色就知道，此事大意不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪里哪里，我可不敢与“梁大人”高攀什么关系，不过要说梁洵此人，倒确实算个朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好朋友难得。十几年没见过了，还能当好朋友的，更难得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你呢，慎师傅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "码头渡口有那么多摆渡师傅，我偏偏上了你的船，你就不奇怪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不奇怪。梁大人交代过我，那多半也交代过你。具体的，我没必要问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是替梁大人从走私贩手里抢来的，费了不少功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我没问，你倒也说了，憋得慌吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "千里迢迢，实在缺个说话的伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你倒是信得过那姓梁的，明明他长了副生人勿近的冷淡嘴脸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎。你信他，是因为他是你朋友，我信他，是因为他是尚蜀的父母官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两位认识？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "认识，梁大人对我们好，就认识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慎师傅做这行多少年了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "记不清啦......谁掰着手指头数自个儿漂泊了多少年呢？约莫有个......二三十年？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慎师傅也值得敬佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "船夫而已，有啥好敬佩的。这几年船都装上发动机了，再过几年，我怕我都要失业。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也得靠人引航寻路，看一路天况如何。想来走水路的船夫，但凡水路长些，岁月久些，也都和天灾信使相去无几了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......天灾啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不常遇到，但要是遇到了，终生难忘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慎师傅遇见过天灾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遇见过，但也见过比天灾更吓人的，不过不是在江上——得了，说这些做什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......稀奇，好像是外国人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，客人两位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是你说的“名声在外，菜品一绝，服务周到，童叟无欺”的行裕客栈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然当然，我师父过去就曾夸奖过“行裕”，一直没机会来尚蜀，这不就特地带恩人找来了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，说来惭愧，师父只是夸了，没说夸什么。所以我也不知道这行裕客栈厉害在哪儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来，茶水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位，打尖还是住店？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇哦，标准的客栈开场词欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，您别说，咱们虽然开张没几年，可真要论“行裕”这个名字，也算个百年老字号啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，反正是要找个落脚处的。这里价格也合适，离约定的北渡口也不远，不如？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是随便啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客房两间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞。现在吃点啥不？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都有什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "推荐套餐就打在牌子上。现在按午市算，您有什么需要，招呼一声就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，我瞧瞧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个看起来不错欸，很有大炎风情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......恩人，这个特辣毛血旺套餐......我们还是别点了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？入乡随俗，干嘛不尝试一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根据我的经验，这种菜品，不适合您这样的雷姆必拓人在中午大快朵颐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是这样吗？我还挺能吃辣的喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看那边那位掌柜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么厉害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有这么大一份家业，当然厉害。不过更厉害的是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......手上有茧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人果然好眼力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且从进门起，二楼就有两位客人在打量咱们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么一直盯着他们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦......怎么那位卡特斯看着这么面熟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "掌柜的，您今天就待咱们这儿？不去渡口那边看看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不去，今儿和人有约了，就在这儿待客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，掌柜的还特地亲自接待，那想必是个大客户了，咱们今天也能开张了？能挣多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "钱未必挣得，事儿倒是少不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是那边的生意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是也不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "此话怎讲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别这么啰嗦，还不快去迎客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，小气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸欢迎光临，几位客官，不知——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_npc_140_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜小姐？您这是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和你没关系，一边去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_300_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇——姑娘好大的嗓门，找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......一身花里胡哨的穿着，戴眼镜，看着神棍的邋遢小哥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就是你了，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃......这评价是不是有点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你的仇家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，再怎么说他们也不至于喊个小丫头来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说谁小丫头呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（一脚挑飞了木椅——好腿法！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。坐着就能躲开，反应倒挺快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大小姐，大小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "干嘛，没看我忙着——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这男人是个黎博利吧，我记得信上说，那人是龙来着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那就是楼上那个人了，是你了，对吧！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，道个歉吧起码！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了好了......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我自觉衣品不错来着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看这架势，来者不善哪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "进门欺负一下木椅，可怜那位小哥险些白挨了一顿打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然已经被本小姐找到，就老老实实把东西交出来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，敢在光天化日之下混进城，你也算胆子大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这位杜小姐，怕是有什么误会吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不是从龙门来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是带着一只古董酒盏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那本小姐给你一分钟时间狡辩。时间到了，就乖乖把东西交了，跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这年头小姑娘都这样不听人话吗......真让人怀念我家那几个懂事的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不用这么看我。梁大人也交代过，这酒盏是他专程托你从龙门带来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然梁大人说了，那我就信任他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是，多谢慎师傅信任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稀奇了......既然是梁大人所托，这小丫头竟然还敢光明正大说要抢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这只酒盏，是我家某位大姑娘从一伙走私贩子手里抢来的，要真说有没有合法手续......哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_294_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "酒盏很奇特？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "调查过一番，只留下些不明所以的传说，是那些走私贩从当地人口中听来的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，怎么就撞上这么麻烦的事情了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小乌有，这一幕我在电影里见过哎！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（我也见过！不过一般这种时候就要喊警察啦，总不至于真打起来......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，别嘀嘀咕咕了，想好借口了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这小姑娘，扯起嗓门中气十足啊......二楼那两位，就是嫌疑人咯？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（恩人？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小乌有......那个人......我好像认识......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（什么？那位确实与我有七分形似两分神似的人？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不是，他......呃......算罗德岛的合作人......还有一分呢？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样吧，这位小姐，反正我已经被你抓到了，逃不掉，不如把警察喊来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想拖延时间是吧，好啊，本小姐倒要看看你能拖延多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给我上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别让他跑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "且慢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么，想给刚才的事讨个公道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你让本小姐办完事，你这两天在这里的开销，本小姐就包了，如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，您先仔细瞧瞧，要是认错了人，咱们揽这茬可就亏大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鲤先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......金头发，看不出睁眼还是闭眼的小兔子......你是罗德岛的干员？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天下之大，大炎之大，尚蜀之大，恩人恰好能在一家小酒馆里他乡遇故知，是多低的概率......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还请各位，给个薄面，莫要扫兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——什么乱七八糟的，你们果然是一伙的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_296_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "围住他们！今天不把赃物交出来，谁也别想走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g07_fairyland_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g07_fairyland_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哦？为何突然有此想法？\n梦见罔两问景，有感而发。\n那我倒是想瞧瞧，这些寻常物件，你打算如何让它们显灵？\n就当是我无心之举吧，别笑话我就是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_g04_yaninn"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "speakerId": "avg_322_lmlee_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么......刚才......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_455_nothing_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩人，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是些普通人，下手轻点哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个黎博利是个练家子的！小心点！这个卡特斯就交给我——欸？人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么二话不说就动起手来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_305_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什、什么时候跑到二楼去了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_1021_kroos2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没必要伤人，小乌有，悠着点哦。"
